# Exclude from build context
.git
.github
docs
*.md
*.png
*.jpg
.DS_Store
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/dist
private
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

# The image-seeded OpenCode skill is Markdown but must remain in the build context.
!etc/devbox/opencode-skills/
!etc/devbox/opencode-skills/opencode-dev-sandbox/
!etc/devbox/opencode-skills/opencode-dev-sandbox/SKILL.md
